The page bundle (ui/dist/index.mjs) is built from this repository's own
sources and bundles no third-party code: React, lucide-react, TanStack
Query and the Kiro Crew App SDK are provided by the Kiro Crew dashboard at
run time. The backend uses only the Python standard library and, at run
time, the Kiro Crew gateway that starts it.
